{"3546840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "来次占卜吧", "steam_appid": 3546840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4830830], "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow Us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be adding English and Japanese localization in the official demo build. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Playtest is available in Chinese only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if you are interested in our game, you are welcome to join our Discord community and get in touch with us there. You could find the Channel Invite Link in this page or scan the invite link QR code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would be very happy to hear feedback and suggestions from all perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/23a0e609c802196e54eb0bbaf5de7ee0.avif?t=1786959078\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missing idols, doomsday prophecies, cursed emails...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsettling urban legends are spreading across the internet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling lost, at the mercy of the fate you can't quite grasp? It's <strong><i>Time 2 Tarot</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/6ac568a701c26d32919038d9a165a669.poster.avif?t=1786959078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/6ac568a701c26d32919038d9a165a669.webm?t=1786959078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/6ac568a701c26d32919038d9a165a669.mp4?t=1786959078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/2a9e002b7e68753a89451acfee611a04.webp?t=1786959078\" width=780 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an internet-famous fortune teller whose predictions always come true.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your little divination parlor and guide your guests toward their &quot;happy&quot; endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/87f309327fecc707bcec1425afdf7c90.poster.avif?t=1786959078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/87f309327fecc707bcec1425afdf7c90.webm?t=1786959078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/87f309327fecc707bcec1425afdf7c90.mp4?t=1786959078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAROT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic Rider–Waite deck, reimagined to fit the story's mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw the cards. Rewrite your clients' fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/3c120c591c2641e192848480e3877681.poster.avif?t=1786959078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/3c120c591c2641e192848480e3877681.webm?t=1786959078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/3c120c591c2641e192848480e3877681.mp4?t=1786959078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALCHEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft magical alchemical materials with your self-developed, fully automatic alchemy machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchant your clients' belongings and give them an edge for what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/a590caa1e48f61c4d9fc156943eea1dc.poster.avif?t=1786959078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/a590caa1e48f61c4d9fc156943eea1dc.webm?t=1786959078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/a590caa1e48f61c4d9fc156943eea1dc.mp4?t=1786959078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURF THE WEB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get edgy. Jack into the information superhighway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your accounts, follow trending news, and keep tabs on your clients' socials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/f5f0f8016e2dd7eca803521aed8bb883.poster.avif?t=1786959078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/f5f0f8016e2dd7eca803521aed8bb883.webm?t=1786959078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/f5f0f8016e2dd7eca803521aed8bb883.mp4?t=1786959078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >多周目探索</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的每一次占卜都会将世界引导向截然不同的方向。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在不同的世界线间穿行，了解不为人知的因果。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >揭示一切的线索也许就隐藏在其中。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/ba3a52fd0dee7cf13af17396df86141c.poster.avif?t=1786959078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/ba3a52fd0dee7cf13af17396df86141c.webm?t=1786959078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/ba3a52fd0dee7cf13af17396df86141c.mp4?t=1786959078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/2c936d0c0e80b1be127764657e85f0d2.webp?t=1786959078\" width=780 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/a5e07fd0d218e47b42c93e7215bd095c.avif?t=1786959078\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/66690cce276fff0a102041f69345708e.avif?t=1786959078\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/f9ad11f9db4d1bf302b76bd32f0fc17e.avif?t=1786959078\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546840/extras/84e15f6e66a8720420f684cdca23cda0.avif?t=1786959078\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https